Two deliberate choices worth knowing before replacing this file:

It is the UMD build, not a minified one — marked publishes no minified browser
bundle, and a readable vendored file is the right trade for a dependency that
parses untrusted diff content inside a page holding the review token.

The version floor is 18.0.2, where GHSA-6v9c-7cg6-27q7 (high, CVSS 7.5, an OOM
via infinite recursion in the tokenizer, affecting >= 18.0.0 <= 18.0.1) is
patched. Do not downgrade below it.

The sha256 above was recorded when the file was vendored. It proves the file
has not changed since; it does not independently establish that the fetched
artifact was authentic.

