pele returns an SVG string. The page never parses it: it goes only into an
<iframe sandbox=""> with a fetch-blocking CSP, so a pele sanitizer bug yields
a wrong drawing, not script in the page that holds the review token. Keep it
that way when replacing this file — never assign its output as HTML here.
